        },
        "fields": {
          "notes": "Antonovsky's exact 1911 preface identifies a 1903 Edition state and reports that each of the three previous editions was a new reworking of its predecessor. Current RSL and RNL records now reconcile one exact Saint Petersburg 1903 second corrected Edition through a shared rc\\1717108 control core, identical transaction value, and matching bibliography while preserving their distinct literal identifier wrappers. RSL reports four remote holdings and RNL reports two actionable remote holdings, 129/5943 and 38.35.6.32; none is a ToS Item. The undefined RNL TEMP row is rejected. The Expression and derivation claim remain provisional, uncollated, and unreviewed; acquisition and examination of source pages remain open."
        },
